# aa a5 group 0x07, read live 2026-07-27 by asking past the five groups the app uses. The
# device answers, but not with colour: parsed as three <brightness><R><G><B> records these
# report brightnesses well past 100 on a 0..100 field. Before the group range-check they
# parsed silently and produced exactly that nonsense, which is the silent-wrong-answer
# failure mode that has twice nearly become a finding. The grammar must refuse them.
id: status_reply_reject_segments_g07
data: status_reply_reject_segments_g07.bin
imports:
  - status_reply
exception: ValidationGreaterThanError
